            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="389" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:18:22,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:26,455</end-time>
                <translation>他对情感的分析真是彻底
ああでも徹底的に感情の分析してますね</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="390" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:18:26,455</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:29,389</end-time>
                <translation>斯宾诺莎为什么会对驱动人的情感
