            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="396" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:18:45,741</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:49,989</end-time>
                <translation>是共和派年轻的领袖扬·德·维特
共和派の若き指導者、ヤンデ・ウィット</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="397" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:18:49,989</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:52,347</end-time>
                <translation>他是一位学者气质浓厚的理性人物
学者肌の理智的な人物で、</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="398" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:18:52,347</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:54,583</end-time>
                <translation>致力于重建国家财政
財政再建を推し進め、</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="399" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:18:54,583</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:57,012</end-time>
                <translation>并试图与纷争不断的邻国
争いが絶えない周辺国とは</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="400" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:18:57,012</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:58,280</end-time>
                <translation>寻求和平
和平を模索</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
