            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="429" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:37,343</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:40,420</end-time>
                <translation>这一事件发生于斯宾诺莎的晚年
この事件はスピノザの晩年に起こったものなので</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="430" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:40,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:43,213</end-time>
                <translation>所以并不是他开始写《伦理学》的直接契机
