            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="502" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:23:21,538</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:22,763</end-time>
                <translation>我也很喜欢
僕も好きなところなんですよ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="503" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:23:22,763</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:25,213</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 他讲究的是程度
つまりね度合いで考えてるんですよ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="504" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:23:25,213</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:27,222</end-time>
                <translation>不是非得完全主动
なんか完全に能動だとか</translation>
