            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="505" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:23:27,222</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:28,560</end-time>
                <translation>或者完全自由
完全に自由だとか</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="506" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:23:28,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,758</end-time>
                <translation>并不是这个意思</translation>
                <original>そういうことじゃなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" time="" index="507" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:23:29,758</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,480</end-time>
                <translation>而是比以前稍微开心一点了吧？
